WEBVTT

00:41:57.230 --> 00:42:00.158
and we as Americans have lost our story.

00:42:00.182 --> 00:42:01.340
We had a story,

00:42:01.364 --> 00:42:04.524
but it was sort of the white male story
of American exceptionalism.

00:42:04.548 --> 00:42:07.518
We need a new story that includes
all the voices who are here.

00:42:07.542 --> 00:42:10.321
So telling that common story
is the third thing.

00:42:10.345 --> 00:42:14.265
And then, I think just our love
for each other is the final thing,

00:42:14.289 --> 00:42:17.456
just creating those neighborhood bonds
that lead to national bonds.

00:42:17.480 --> 00:42:22.106
CA: Have you seen any leaders
adopting some of this thinking?

00:42:22.130 --> 00:42:27.670
Is this just going to be subjects
for columns for years to come,

00:42:27.694 --> 00:42:31.086
or might the country,
and not just this country, other countries